  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICMPS-BIG Transforming peace zone into peace hub</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Component 1: Research on Social Enterprise Development Zones (SEDZ) Viability in Normalization Sites. Conduct community-level research and mapping to assess the readiness of normalization sites for SE development, focusing on sectors such as Halal enterprises, traditional crafts, and agri-based value chains
Component 2: Capacity Building on Social Enterprise and Cooperative Development. Build the capacity of the Cooperative and Social Enterprise Authority (CSEA) and local leaders through values-based social enterprise and cooperative training, grounded in Islamic principles such as Maqasid al-Shariah
Component 3: Development of SEDZ Implementation Framework. Co-develop a practical SEDZ Implementation Framework that will guide future programming and piloting of SE initiatives in post-conflict zones</narrative>
  </description>
